# GemGrade Visual & UI

## Brand colors

- Gold: `#D4AF37`
- Black: `#111111`
- White: `#FFFFFF`

## Primary CTAs

Primary buttons use GemGrade gold. Avoid default blue/white buttons unless justified.

Required primary button traits:

- Gold background, black bold text
- 14–16px border radius, 56–60px height
- Smooth transitions, hover lift, soft gold glow, pointer cursor

Important actions must immediately draw attention.

## UI review (after every task)

As a senior UI/UX designer, check:

- Does it look premium and match GemGrade?
- Visually balanced? Primary action obvious?
- Anything distracting? Spacing/typography consistent?
- Can trust be improved?

If improvements don't change functionality, make them—then briefly explain what you improved.
